# Normalize line endings to LF for this project.
#
# Windows/WSL checkouts otherwise write CRLF into the working tree while git
# stores LF, which flips every line in `git diff` and buries real changes in
# EOL noise. `text=auto eol=lf` tells git to store text as LF and check it out
# as LF on every platform, killing that noise at the source.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Leave binaries untouched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.whl  binary
